<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
  <!--
    The base controls, put on the design system's palette.

    Everything the app *classes* (Border.card, Button.rowButton, ...) already paints from
    Themes/Tokens.axaml. The controls it does not class — a plain Button, a ComboBox, a Slider,
    a ScrollBar — are drawn by the FluentTheme from FluentTheme's own palette, which is a
    different family of greys and a different blue. The result reads as two design systems in one
    window: the toolbar buttons sit in Fluent's grey next to our cards, and in dark the ComboBox
    border is near-white against a SurfaceLine hairline everywhere else.

    Fluent's control themes do not hardcode those colours: every one of them is a
    `{DynamicResource}` against a named key (`ButtonBackground`, `ComboBoxBorderBrush`,
    `SliderTrackFill`, ...) declared in the theme's own resources. This file redeclares those keys
    against our roles. Because Application.Resources is consulted before Application.Styles, ours
    win, and every Fluent control inherits the design system without a single restyled template.

    Three rules the file follows:
      - It is an *alias map*, not a palette. Every entry is `<StaticResource>` pointing at a role
        in Tokens.axaml; there is no colour value anywhere below. A role changes in one place.
      - It is scoped to the control types the app actually puts on screen. Re-skinning all of
        Fluent would be a much larger surface with no user visible in it.
      - Both variants carry the same keys. Dark and Light differ only where the design law
        "light is not an inversion" forces them to — see the accent ramp below.

    The neutral ramp, shared by every control that reads as a surface:

      | state       | face          | border               | text         |
      | rest        | SurfaceBar    | SurfaceBorderRaised  | TextPrimary  |
      | pointerover | SurfaceRaised | SurfaceLineHigh      | TextPrimary  |
      | pressed     | SurfaceLine   | SurfaceLineHigh      | TextPrimary  |
      | disabled    | SurfaceInset  | SurfaceLine          | TextDisabled |

    A field (TextBox, ComboBox) rests on SurfaceInset instead — it is a hole in the panel, not a
    thing on top of it — and takes the accent on its border when focused.

    The accent ramp is the one place the two variants diverge. The colour that sits *on* an accent
    fill flips with the variant (AccentText is near-black in dark, white in light), so a state that
    brightens the fill is legible in dark and illegible in light. Each variant therefore moves the
    fill away from its own label colour: dark brightens on hover (AccentLinkHover) and deepens on
    press (AccentSelectedRing); light deepens on hover (AccentSelectedRing) and lifts back to the
    base accent on press. In both, the label stays AccentText and never loses contrast.
  -->

  <!-- Shape, from Themes/Geometry.axaml. Theme-independent, so declared once, outside the variant
       dictionaries: `ControlCornerRadius` is the radius Fluent gives buttons, fields and menu rows,
       and `OverlayCornerRadius` the one it gives popups and drop-downs. -->
  <StaticResource x:Key="ControlCornerRadius" ResourceKey="RadiusControl" />
  <StaticResource x:Key="OverlayCornerRadius" ResourceKey="RadiusPanel" />

  <ResourceDictionary.ThemeDictionaries>

    <!-- ================================================================================
         DARK.
         ================================================================================ -->
    <ResourceDictionary x:Key="Dark">

      <!-- ===== Button, RepeatButton ============================================================
           The toolbar (Home / Settings / Help) and the editor's action row (Reset Layer, Export,
           Import). RepeatButton is the NumericUpDown spinner and the ScrollBar's line buttons. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonBackground" ResourceKey="SurfaceBarBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonBackgroundDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonForeground" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonForegroundPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonBorderBrush" ResourceKey="SurfaceBorderRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonBorderBrushPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonBorderBrushPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ButtonBorderBrushDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />

      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonBackground" ResourceKey="SurfaceBarBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonBackgroundDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonForeground" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonForegroundPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonBorderBrush" ResourceKey="SurfaceBorderRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonBorderBrushPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonBorderBrushPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RepeatButtonBorderBrushDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />

      <!-- ===== Accent button ===================================================================
           The palette behind Button.primaryAction (Save, Ok, Assign) in Styles/Buttons.axaml, and
           behind Fluent's own `accent` class. An accent *fill* with AccentText on it: the accent
           as a foreground on a neutral face is 2.4-2.8:1 in light, which is not a label. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonBackground" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonBackgroundDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonForeground" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonForegroundPressed" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonBorderBrush" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonBorderBrushPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonBorderBrushPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="AccentButtonBorderBrushDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />

      <!-- ===== ComboBox ========================================================================
           The device picker on the no-device screen and the settings panel's choice rows. Its
           resting border is the loudest wrong-palette element in the dark app today: Fluent gives
           it 60% white, where every hairline around it is SurfaceLine. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBackground" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBackgroundUnfocused" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBackgroundDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBorderBrush" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBorderBrushPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBorderBrushPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBorderBrushDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBackgroundBorderBrushFocused" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxBackgroundBorderBrushUnfocused" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxForeground" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxForegroundFocused" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxForegroundFocusedPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxPlaceHolderForeground" ResourceKey="TextMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxPlaceHolderForegroundFocusedPressed" ResourceKey="TextMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxDropDownBackground" ResourceKey="SurfacePanelBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxDropDownBorderBrush" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxDropDownGlyphForeground" ResourceKey="TextMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxDropDownGlyphForegroundFocused" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxDropDownGlyphForegroundFocusedPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxDropDownGlyphForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />

      <!-- One row of the drop-down. Selection is the accent's own job, so it is the translucent
           selection fill plus the selected-row inset ring, exactly as a selected list row. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemBackgroundSelected" ResourceKey="AccentSelectionFillBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemBackgroundSelectedPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentSelectionFillBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemBackgroundSelectedPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectionFillBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemBorderBrushSelected" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemForeground" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemForegroundPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemForegroundSelected" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemForegroundSelectedPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemForegroundSelectedPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ComboBoxItemForegroundSelectedDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />

      <!-- ===== TextBox =========================================================================
           The Search Keys query, the Tap and Hold delay, the macro delay. A field is inset in the
           panel and takes the accent only on focus. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlBackground" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlBackgroundFocused" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlBackgroundDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlBorderBrush" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlBorderBrushPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlBorderBrushFocused" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlBorderBrushDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlForeground" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlForegroundFocused" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlPlaceholderForeground" ResourceKey="TextMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlPlaceholderForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlPlaceholderForegroundFocused" ResourceKey="TextFaintBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlPlaceholderForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <!-- Named "Color" by Fluent but typed as a brush. Translucent, so selected text keeps its
           own colour rather than needing an on-accent foreground the theme does not expose. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlSelectionHighlightColor" ResourceKey="AccentSelectionFillBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlButtonBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlButtonBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlButtonForeground" ResourceKey="TextMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlButtonForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="TextControlButtonForegroundPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />

      <!-- ===== CheckBox ========================================================================
           The settings "Disable" boxes, the Export scope, the message box's suppression opt-out.
           Fluent's own root Background/BorderBrush keys are already transparent and are left
           alone; what is painted is the little box (CheckBackground*) and its glyph. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundUnchecked" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundUncheckedPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundUncheckedPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundUncheckedDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundChecked" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundCheckedPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundCheckedPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundCheckedDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundIndeterminate" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundIndeterminatePointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundIndeterminatePressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxForegroundIndeterminateDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />

      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillUnchecked" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillUncheckedPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillUncheckedPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillUncheckedDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeUnchecked" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeUncheckedPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeUncheckedPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeUncheckedDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />

      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillChecked" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillCheckedPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillCheckedPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillCheckedDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeCheckedPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeCheckedPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeCheckedDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckGlyphForegroundChecked" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckGlyphForegroundCheckedPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckGlyphForegroundCheckedPressed" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckGlyphForegroundCheckedDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />

      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillIndeterminate" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillIndeterminatePointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillIndeterminatePressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundFillIndeterminateDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeIndeterminate" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeIndeterminatePointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeIndeterminatePressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckBackgroundStrokeIndeterminateDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckGlyphForegroundIndeterminate" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckGlyphForegroundIndeterminatePointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckGlyphForegroundIndeterminatePressed" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="CheckBoxCheckGlyphForegroundIndeterminateDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />

      <!-- ===== RadioButton =====================================================================
           The macro delay panel's random/custom choice. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonForeground" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonForegroundPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseStroke" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseStrokePointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseStrokePressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseStrokeDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseFillPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseCheckedFill" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseCheckedFillPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseCheckedFillPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseCheckedFillDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseCheckedStroke" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseCheckedStrokePointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseCheckedStrokePressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonOuterEllipseCheckedStrokeDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonCheckGlyphFill" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonCheckGlyphFillPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonCheckGlyphFillPressed" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="RadioButtonCheckGlyphFillDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />

      <!-- ===== Slider ==========================================================================
           The settings speeds and the lighting speed. The unfilled half of the track is a
           SurfaceLineHigh hairline rather than Fluent's 40% white, which all but disappears
           against a card; the filled half and the thumb are the accent, because the value is
           what the user changed. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTrackFill" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTrackFillPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTrackFillPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTrackFillDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTrackValueFill" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTrackValueFillPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTrackValueFillPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTrackValueFillDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderThumbBackground" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderThumbBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderThumbBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderThumbBackgroundDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTickBarFill" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderTickBarFillDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="SliderInlineTickBarFill" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />

      <!-- ===== ToggleSwitch ====================================================================
           The settings panel's on/off rows. Off is an inset track with a muted knob; on is the
           accent with AccentText riding it. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchContentForeground" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchHeaderForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchFillOff" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchFillOffPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchFillOffPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchStrokeOff" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchStrokeOffPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchStrokeOffPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchStrokeOffDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <!-- The knob is the one place a text role is used as a fill: it has to read against both an
           inset track and the panel behind it, and the surface ramp has no step that does in both
           variants. TextMuted is that step in each. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchKnobFillOff" ResourceKey="TextMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchKnobFillOffPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextBodyMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchKnobFillOffPressed" ResourceKey="TextBodyMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchKnobFillOffDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchFillOn" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchFillOnPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchFillOnPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchFillOnDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchStrokeOn" ResourceKey="AccentBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchStrokeOnPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentLinkHoverBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchStrokeOnPressed" ResourceKey="AccentSelectedRingBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchStrokeOnDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchKnobFillOn" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchKnobFillOnPointerOver" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchKnobFillOnPressed" ResourceKey="AccentTextBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ToggleSwitchKnobFillOnDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />

      <!-- ===== Expander ========================================================================
           The editor's invalid-line block. Fluent types most of these as `Color` rather than a brush, so
           the aliases point at the Color half of the token pair; the handful it types as a brush
           are marked by their target. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderBackground" ResourceKey="SurfaceBarColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderBackgroundDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderBorderBrush" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderBorderBrushPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderBorderBrushPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderBorderBrushDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderForeground" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderForegroundPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderHeaderForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderContentBackground" ResourceKey="SurfacePanelColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderContentBorderBrush" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderChevronBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderChevronBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderChevronForeground" ResourceKey="TextMutedColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderChevronForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderChevronForegroundPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ExpanderChevronForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />

      <!-- ===== ScrollBar =======================================================================
           Every scrolling surface in the app. The thumb is a hairline that thickens on hover, not
           a bar of 20% white; the track it expands into is the inset, not a slab of grey. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarThumbBackgroundColor" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineColor" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarThumbFillPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarThumbFillPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarThumbFillDisabled" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarTrackFill" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarTrackFillPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceInsetBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarTrackStroke" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarTrackStrokePointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarButtonBackgroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="SurfaceRaisedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarButtonBackgroundPressed" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarButtonArrowForeground" ResourceKey="TextMutedBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarButtonArrowForegroundPointerOver" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarButtonArrowForegroundPressed" ResourceKey="TextPrimaryBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarButtonArrowForegroundDisabled" ResourceKey="TextDisabledBrush" />
      <!-- The resting thumb: the compact bar drawn before the pointer reaches the rail. Fluent
           paints it from the panning key rather than from a "ThumbFill" one, which is why this
           alias and not just the three state fills above. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarPanningThumbBackground" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="ScrollBarPanningThumbBackgroundColor" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineHighColor" />

      <!-- ===== Flyouts, menus, tooltips ========================================================
           The Savant Elite2 Special Actions menu and the drop-downs. A flyout is a floating panel,
           so it takes the panel surface and the same hairline every card has. -->
      <StaticResource x:Key="FlyoutPresenterBackground" ResourceKey="SurfacePanelBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="FlyoutBorderThemeBrush" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="MenuFlyoutPresenterBackground" ResourceKey="SurfacePanelBrush" />
      <StaticResource x:Key="MenuFlyoutPresenterBorderBrush" ResourceKey="SurfaceLineBrush" />
